{
  "video_id": "4miN4OTcJM0",
  "title": "Claude Can Now Watch Any Video for You",
  "description": "Comment \"VIDEO\" under the post and I'll send you the link.\n\n@claudeai can now watch videos for you. A new GitHub tool called Claude Watch just dropped. You paste a link to someone's viral video, and Claude breaks it down frame by frame, grounded in the actual frames and audio rather than the title or description. It tells you the hook in the first three seconds, what's on screen, how the scene is built, and why the video went viral. It works with TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, X and hundreds of other sources, and it's just as useful for ad creative, competitor launches and podcast intros, anything where the how matters as much as the what. Best accuracy is on clips under 10 minutes, and for longer videos you can point it at a specific section.\n\n#ai #claude #contentcreation #aitools #videomarketing",
  "publishedAt": "2026-06-24T07:47:48Z",
  "channel_name": "Yury AI",
  "transcript": "Comment \"VIDEO\" under the post and I'll send you the link.\n\n@claudeai can now watch videos for you. A new GitHub tool called Claude Watch just dropped. You paste a link to someone's viral video, and Claude breaks it down frame by frame, grounded in the actual frames and audio rather than the title or description. It tells you the hook in the first three seconds, what's on screen, how the scene is built, and why the video went viral. It works with TikTok, YouTube, Instagram, X and hundreds of other sources, and it's just as useful for ad creative, competitor launches and podcast intros, anything where the how matters as much as the what. Best accuracy is on clips under 10 minutes, and for longer videos you can point it at a specific section.\n\n#ai #claude #contentcreation #aitools #videomarketing",
